<title>GHANA: Ghana Stock Exchange closes lower.</title>
<headline>Ghana Stock Exchange closes lower.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ghana Stock Exchange closed lower on Friday with the GSE All-Share Index down 1.15 points to to 384.39 from 385.54.</p>
<p>Losses spread across all sectors, pulled down by weighty stock Ashanti Goldfields Co Ltd which fell 500 cedis to 29,500.</p>
<p>$ = 1,690 cedis</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom tel +225 21 90 90</p>
